  "description": "PdfSharp for .NET Core (forked by Moondigo)\n\nPdfSharpCore is a partial port of PdfSharp.Xamarin for .NET Core Additionally MigraDoc has been ported as well (from version 1.32). Images have been implemented with ImageSharp from https://www.nuget.org/packages/SixLabors.ImageSharp",
