  "releaseNotes": "PdfSharpCore (forked by Moondigo) \n\t- 1.0.6: Dependancies updated. Droppped support for older .net frameworks version and added 9.0 (no significant code changes, but testing against 9.0), fixed irefs for compressed objects (merged from origin)\n\t- 1.0.5: Added experimental compressed objects streams support that can actually work (/Type ObjStm) - for accuracy Lazy. Original library caused problems when particular stream /Length dictionary directed to object reference like \"10 0 R\" and that object is in compressed object stream (/Type ObjStm).",
